Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.65,0:01:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥马尔 将军那里情况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Omar, what's the status on the general.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还和家人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still with family.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.53,0:01:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,来尝尝这个美味的吧 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tule ja proovi midagi maitsvat, poeg me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.66,0:01:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不吃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.09,0:01:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈姆萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hamza.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.21,0:01:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈姆萨 别睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hamza ra maga enam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.97,0:01:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,空袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}hurünnak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.15,0:01:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快带他们一起去地下避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go with them. Take them to the bunker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.61,0:01:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.38,0:02:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,费赞将军在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is General Fezzan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也许很复杂 但我不是他妈的绝望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might be complicated, but I ain't fucking hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们所说的复杂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what we call it Complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管叫什么都没用 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatever it's called, it's not working, is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.26,0:04:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托吉娜 你不考虑大局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Gina, you're not looking at the big picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.26,0:04:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,大局是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the big picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.63,0:04:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗 你是我的大局吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it you Are you my big picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.01,0:04:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的别自以为是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get the fuck over yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.14,0:04:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你知道你实际上是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you know what you actually are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个原始人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A caveman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.73,0:04:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确实像原始人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do resemble a caveman. You know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不像吗 - 你不想和他争一争吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you don't - You don't want competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉娜 拜托 冷静点 这就是你的问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gina, please, calm down. That's what your problem is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我冷静下来 你刚才是不是告诉我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me calm down Did you just tell me…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.03,0:04:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别他妈的叫我冷静下来 我很冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me to fucking calm down I'm calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子从来没有他妈的这么冷静过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been more fucking calm in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.53,0:04:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Oh, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是英国人 我是逃避型 我不喜欢争论\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm English. I'm avoidant. I don't like to argue."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.62,0:04:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜怎么着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, guess what.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想要平静的生活 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want a little peace in my life. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那会很好的 - 我是美国人 婊子 我们会为此而争吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It'd be nice. - I'm from America, bitch. We're gonna fight about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.17,0:04:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走 快走 - 走 那我算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go. Just go. - Go. So what does that make me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我有压力吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that make me stressful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.05,0:05:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有点暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little violent perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.64,0:05:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是专业人士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.14,0:05:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 就是有点暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And a little violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.31,0:05:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teeny bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.77,0:05:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么回事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.10,0:05:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有和你一样的技能 甚至会更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got your skills and then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.14,0:05:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们俩都不喜欢我这样 因为你们都是原始人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And neither of you like it because you're both cavemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在跟你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.07,0:05:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上她正朝你那边看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, she's looking in your direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.90,0:05:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在跟你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.49,0:05:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或许是我的领导\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might be my boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.99,0:05:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道你来自一个叫「绝望」的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can tell that you're also from this planet called "hopeless"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.28,0:05:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里 亲密的关系和感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}where intimate relationships and feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.83,0:05:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,都他妈的不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't fucking exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.79,0:05:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的宝贝 我在你身上浪费了太多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking baby. I've wasted so much of my life on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.79,0:05:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个失败者 但我喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a loser. But I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把戒指丢在酒吧了 我需要你帮忙…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my ring at this bar, and I need you to…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 就这样吗 我们谈完了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Is that it Are we done talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.81,0:05:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次谈话结束了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you done with this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.85,0:05:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.48,0:05:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,更像是愤怒的喋喋不休\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more like angry chatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.89,0:05:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,操你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.98,0:06:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她又在跟你说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's talking to you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.82,0:06:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太压抑了 - 不 没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's depressing. - No. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢她 巴尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked her, Barney.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.16,0:06:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是敢死队的 圣诞\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's an Expendable, Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.79,0:06:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我尊重你的超凡能力 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I got great respect for your uncanny abilities. I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你真的是个自私的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are a selfish prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.13,0:06:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 我们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really - We all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.59,0:06:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须选择这种生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to be to choose this life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.64,0:06:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是选择朋友 家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}over friends, over family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.60,0:06:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这么做是为了钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do this for money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.35,0:06:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是「混蛋主义」的定义\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the definition of prickism.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.02,0:06:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我的观点怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think of my analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.90,0:06:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得…你是个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.19,0:06:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身体里的每一个细胞都觉得是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}With every cell in my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.07,0:06:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.61,0:06:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨晚打赌把戒指丢了 现在我来试着把它买回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my ring last night in a bet, and I'm here to try to buy it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.91,0:06:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.87,0:06:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}A silly little trinket.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:07:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很迷信 而且我喜欢它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm superstitious about it, and I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.33,0:07:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉像是我少了一根手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel like I'm missing a finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想把他拿回来 但这个白痴不愿意谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried getting it back, but this half-ass won't negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁 - 珍宝虾\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who - Jumbo Shrimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.01,0:07:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是谁 - 你会看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's he - You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样了 巴尼 - 嘿 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's up, Barney - Hey, Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.93,0:07:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么失去你最珍贵的戒指的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how'd you lose your most prized possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.98,0:07:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,拇指摔跤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thumb wrestling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.94,0:07:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是说掰手腕 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean arm wrestling - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是说 拇指摔跤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean thumb wrestling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像那样 把你的手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that. Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.11,0:07:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 拇指摔跤\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Thumb wrestling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.41,0:07:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前很强的 发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to be strong. What happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.28,0:07:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前很多头发的 发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you used to be hairy. What happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.79,0:07:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,世事无常嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things change.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.62,0:07:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样了 巴尼 - 有什么新鲜事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's up, Barney - Hey, how you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍宝虾在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jumbo Shrimp around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.08,0:07:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友想要回他的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend wants his ring back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.63,0:07:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,打赌就是打赌 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet's a bet, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的 无意冒犯 但我想念我的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, no offense, but I'm missing my ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.42,0:07:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会留在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It stays where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.01,0:07:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太无法接受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:08:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,太像了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Striking resemblance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太残忍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.61,0:08:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是这些人吗 巴尼 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- These the guys, Barney - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我明白为什么他们叫他巨无霸（珍宝虾）了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I see why they call him Jumbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.61,0:08:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是另一个人 那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the other guy, second guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你输给了圣诞老人的助手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost to Santa's helper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.37,0:08:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太尴尬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.83,0:08:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喝醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.95,0:08:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你现在没醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're not drunk now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.08,0:08:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底为什么会在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the fuck am I here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.67,0:08:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的背受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hurt my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.13,0:08:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.30,0:08:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,几周前我连叉子都拿不起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few weeks ago. I can't even lift a fork.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你的 但如果你不想 我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would do it for you. But if you don't want to do it, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你被吓到了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're intimidated…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intimidated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.30,0:08:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.68,0:08:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴上它会让你自己更轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it easy on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.60,0:08:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,经典神器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The classics.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.43,0:08:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来搞定 大块头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this, Thumbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,请来瓶啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beer, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.40,0:08:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这美好的一天你过得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing this nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.86,0:08:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望我叫你珍宝还是小虾\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you prefer to be called, "Jumbo" or "Shrimp"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.62,0:09:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,再这么叫我一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.46,0:09:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把你破脑袋砍下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut your fucking head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.21,0:09:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有点刺耳 小不点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a little harsh, bite-size.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.34,0:09:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尼想要回他的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barney wants his ring back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.80,0:09:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.63,0:09:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,要多少钱 尤达 （星战中的角色）\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much for it back, Yoda.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.26,0:09:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指要留在这里 白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}It stays here, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.89,0:09:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的背\N{\fnArial\fs30}My back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.85,0:09:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,如你所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里所面临的是羞辱和仁慈的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}what we have here is a matter of humiliation and human kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.40,0:09:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这位朋友很喜欢他的戒指 因为他那些愚蠢的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend here loves his ring for all of his stupid reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果各位先生们能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it would be very nice and civilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.07,0:09:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样会很好 很文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you gents would understand that principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.74,0:09:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但既然你选择了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But since you choose to be…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.91,0:09:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巴尼 怎么说来着 - 冥顽不灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Barney, what's the word - Obstinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.83,0:09:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,换个短点的词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.04,0:09:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dumbbells.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.17,0:09:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dumbbells.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.17,0:09:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我别无选择 你个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave me no other choice, dinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.39,0:10:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不用谢 - 你变慢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're welcome. - You're slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.77,0:10:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,该我了 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}My turn, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.86,0:10:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 来吧 牛仔 放马过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, chuck. Come on, cowboy. Bring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.25,0:10:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他醒来时 给他准备好啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him a beer when he wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You almost killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.34,0:10:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你背疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you had a bad back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.47,0:10:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个奇迹 刚刚康复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's a miracle. It just went away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我真的不需要这样的「爱情盛宴」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I really didn't need this lovefest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.51,0:10:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢和你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like spending time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.06,0:10:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次带我去骑马 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time, take me on a pony ride, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.24,0:10:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,侦察小队 情况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Overwatch, what is the status.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 有三个士兵保护着将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, there are three soldiers guarding the general.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.14,0:11:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.22,0:11:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我重复一遍 等待支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, wait for backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.23,0:11:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的 他在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is he doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.19,0:11:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 求你了不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. No, no, please. Please, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.30,0:12:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,近来可好 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.06,0:12:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是我眼花了吗 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are my eyes deceiving me - Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.77,0:12:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,贡纳头上戴了个什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that thing on Gunner's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像一只生病的猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like a sick cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可爱的猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cats are cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那看起来像风滚草\N{\fnArial\fs30}That looks like tumbleweed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.16,0:12:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 大个子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, good evening, big man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.33,0:12:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来谈谈你头上的东西是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk. What's that thing on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.37,0:12:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个假发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the wig.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.33,0:12:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 假发 - 问题是 为什么戴假发\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, the wig. - Question is, why.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在网上和一个女孩聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was chatting with this girl on the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.09,0:12:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她喜欢70年代的造型\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she likes that '70s look, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.17,0:12:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,费拉·福赛特的形象\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Farrah Fawcett thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.46,0:12:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,理解 你见过她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it. You met her yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要见她 我喜欢神秘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why… Why would I do that I like the mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.80,0:12:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白吗 - 明白 很有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Understand - Yeah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.39,0:12:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看起来很特别 - 确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sounds special. - It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.39,0:12:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更喜欢他喝醉的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked him better when he was a drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你的意思 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you mean. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.35,0:12:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你感到高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.86,0:13:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是新来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, is this the new guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.69,0:13:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 轻松哥来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's Easy Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好男人 前特种部队成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good man. Ex-special forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.78,0:13:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 巴尼 - 嘿 轻松哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Barney. - Hey, Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的狙击手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This our sniper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.37,0:13:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我有专门为我眼镜设计的瞄准镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it. I got a prescription scope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.29,0:13:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧鹰眼 记住这张脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Hawkeyes, remember this face.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.29,0:13:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shoot it by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.96,0:13:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.92,0:13:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你越来越不行了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're slipping, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.09,0:13:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你雇了他 他是加列戈的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hired him. That's Galgo's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.09,0:13:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我遗传了我父亲的视力和心灵还有性欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the eyesight, the heart and the sex drive of my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我他跟他父亲一样话多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me he doesn't talk as much as his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他话更多 - 不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's worse. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.14,0:13:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是双倍的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twice as bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.48,0:13:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将是一个漫长的旅程\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be a long trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.02,0:13:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是加兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Galan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.81,0:13:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有什么意义吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That suppose to mean something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.07,0:13:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该有点意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's supposed to mean a little something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了别废话了 都看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, cut the bullshit. All eyes on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.11,0:13:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿西装的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.12,0:13:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫马什\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Marsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.24,0:13:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在认识你之前我和他合作过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did a few things with him before I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.37,0:13:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是中情局的 - 嘿 巴尼 最近怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's CIA. - Hey, Barney, how you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.83,0:13:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 马什\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing, Marsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.33,0:13:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How they hanging.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.08,0:14:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,状态恢复中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gravity's setting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.84,0:14:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我很想和你们寒暄一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}As much as I would like to exchange pleasantries with you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.21,0:14:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但手头有一件急事\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a pressing matter at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.13,0:14:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,认识下苏瓦尔图·拉赫马特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet Suharato Rahmat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.89,0:14:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个前英国公民变成了军火商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Former British national turned arms dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.18,0:14:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有一支私人军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has his own private army and he's been hired.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.31,0:14:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被一个非常危险的客户雇去\N{\fnArial\fs30}to steal some detonators for nuclear missiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.27,0:14:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷一些核导弹的引爆装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a very dangerous client.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.56,0:14:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有传言说那个客户的名字叫「豹猫」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word on the street is the client's name is Ocelot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.61,0:14:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那些核炸药落入豹猫之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, those detonators get in the hands of Ocelot,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打算使用它们制造国际混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's planning on using them to create an international incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.53,0:14:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝不能允许这种情况发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.03,0:14:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你们来的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's where you guys come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.62,0:14:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,降落后你会发现卡扎菲在利比亚的旧军用化工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your landing zone is Qaddafi's old chemical war plant in Libya,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说每年这个时候那里很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I hear is very nice this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的任务是确保核炸药留在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mission is to make sure the detonators stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道这么多 祝好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I got. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.13,0:14:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尼 保证他们的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barney, keep 'em tucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.26,0:14:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.68,0:14:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 豹猫行动 - 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Operation Ocelot. - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.85,0:14:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算什么时候告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}When were you gonna tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.71,0:14:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你不再惹你女朋友的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you stopped playing footsies with your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么圣诞对豹猫的任务这么生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, why's Christmas so pissed about this Ocelot mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.82,0:15:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just being Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.20,0:15:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白 - 他很了解巴尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Copy that. - He knows Barney very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.95,0:15:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很清楚该怎么做才能消灭豹猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows exactly how far he's willing to go to end Ocelot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.41,0:15:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁自称豹猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell names himself Ocelot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.79,0:15:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前中情局就雇佣了巴尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years ago, the CIA hired Barney.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.71,0:15:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,来找出谁的代号是豹猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find out who code name "Ocelot" actually is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.75,0:15:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他查的很接近了 然后有人伏击了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was close when somebody walked him into an ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.21,0:15:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点灭了他的整个团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nearly killed his entire team.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.55,0:15:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.22,0:15:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说豹猫只是巴尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, some would say Ocelot's a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.43,0:15:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了掩盖自己的错误而创造出来的幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Barney created to cover his own ass for a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.68,0:15:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fucking way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.23,0:15:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,豹猫确实存在 巴尼总有一天会把它埋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ocelot exists and Barney will bury him someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的耳朵怎么了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck happened to your ear, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.61,0:15:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你问这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you asked me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.15,0:15:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大学时是摔跤运动员 这类运动的常见并发症是耳朵损伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wrestled in college. Common affliction in that sport is contusions to the ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.70,0:15:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些血液在耳软骨中聚集…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small pocket of blood that separates the skin from the cartilage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.09,0:16:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,翱翔吧 大鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, big bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.26,0:16:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上去吧 你这个「死亡陷阱」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up there, you deathtrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.30,0:16:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别侮辱它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't insult it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.56,0:16:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功起飞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a successful liftoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.53,0:16:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能是我第一次三人行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it was my first ménage à trois.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.87,0:16:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔·罗德 你知道我在说什么对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know. You know, Toll Road, what I'm talking about, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.21,0:16:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道什么是「黄金雨」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what is a golden shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.38,0:16:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是一个女人她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's when the woman, she…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.59,0:16:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跪在你身上然后往你身上撒尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She squats down on top of you and releases her bladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.22,0:16:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一种非常解放的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very liberating.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.30,0:16:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 国际变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, a world-class pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.30,0:16:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道什么是「黄金雨」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what is a golden shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:17:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来像是以前干过这种事的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like the type who has had one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.18,0:17:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要裁掉这些废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm cutting these losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.27,0:17:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我听过太多了 - 现在是调音时间 该听音乐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I heard too much of that. - It's tune time. Time for music.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.90,0:17:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,太老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ancient.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.07,0:17:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,很舒缓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's soothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.48,0:17:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 舒缓吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Soothing - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.19,0:17:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.57,0:17:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我昨晚焦虑发作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I had a panic attack last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 你确定 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you really Are you sure - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.54,0:17:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你的皮肤开始起鸡皮疙瘩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like your skin starts to crawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.16,0:17:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 心跳加速 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your heart is beating - You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.91,0:17:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃点安眠药 假装你对生活很满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take some Xanax and pretend you're happy with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.71,0:17:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说一句你是史上最差的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, you're the worst doctor, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.30,0:17:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吉娜对你太苛刻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's Gina who's making you anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她能让我平静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She actually relaxes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.13,0:17:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是…工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's this… this… The job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.30,0:17:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.85,0:17:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些男人根本就不适合谈恋爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some guys are just not meant for companionship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.10,0:17:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 面对现实吧 - 太糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Face the facts. - Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.18,0:17:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你想以痛苦的老样子死去 但我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you want to die a bitter old sod, but not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.94,0:17:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要开朗 快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be cheerful, happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.90,0:17:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我会去疗养院看你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will come visit you in the home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.24,0:17:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你保证吗 - 以名誉担保\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Promise - Scout's honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.99,0:17:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们看看发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女孩在我身上滴了热蜡\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them was covering me in hot candle wax.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.25,0:18:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,核炸药在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the detonators.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.46,0:18:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.21,0:18:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动我老婆 不 真主是最伟大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my wife. No, Allahu Akbar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.05,0:18:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个就是你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son is next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 别动我儿子 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}P-Please, not my son. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.14,0:18:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,把核炸药给我 我很快就能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the detonators, and I'll make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.18,0:18:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子 亚当…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son, Adam…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你无法改变的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a fact you cannot change.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.85,0:18:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,把核炸药给我 否则…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the detonators or…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.56,0:18:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.10,0:18:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,决定权在你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.11,0:18:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.11,0:18:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在控制室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are in control room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全密码是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The code to the safe is…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.95,0:18:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,八\N{\fnArial\fs30}eight,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.66,0:18:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}one,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.57,0:18:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnArial\fs30}four,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.91,0:18:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}two…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.62,0:18:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,七\N{\fnArial\fs30}seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.04,0:18:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,明智的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wise choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,来叫醒孩子们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's wake up the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.29,0:18:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.69,0:19:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是从哪里来的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd that come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会很有趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, this is gonna be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.82,0:19:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 遭到攻击 - 开始反击\N{\fnArial\fs30}- LZ's hot. - Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.86,0:19:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来了 - 高射炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Incoming - Flak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.20,0:19:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,情报有误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intel was off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.37,0:19:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,要有创意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get creative.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.08,0:19:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,探探底就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touch and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.71,0:19:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 集合 振作起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, rally up. Rally up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.75,0:19:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来开路好吗 - 不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Am I driving lead - Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,带贡纳去监视 然后投入战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take Gunner to overwatch and fall in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.26,0:19:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,着陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.23,0:19:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你狩猎愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.20,0:20:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看 武器工厂出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out. There's something happening at the weapons plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.07,0:20:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在查看\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.04,0:20:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有四辆车和许多士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I count four vehicles and a lot of ops.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们来努力削减对方人数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's make less of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.13,0:20:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我有一种新的交通工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I have a new transport.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.89,0:20:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉豹猫我们拿到核炸药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Ocelot we have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.01,0:20:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,已就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}In position.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.69,0:20:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Load up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉赫马特有核炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rahmat's got the detonators.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.19,0:20:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,贡纳 你看到他们了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunner, you got eyes on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.86,0:20:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标就像车前灯的灯罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like crystal in headlights.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.45,0:20:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,贡纳 你没击中目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunner, you're way off target.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.95,0:20:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要导盲犬吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you need, a seeing-eye dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的污渍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:21:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 史蒂夫·旺德 你应该检查一下你的瞄准镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Stevie Wonder, you might want to get that prescription checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.26,0:21:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 李 你在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up. Lee, where are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.84,0:21:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们要开始行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we're making our entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.80,0:21:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓稳你的枪把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on to your huevos.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.06,0:21:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们起飞吧 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's fly, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.32,0:21:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the fuck is this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.58,0:21:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.63,0:21:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,贡纳 我们需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunner, we could use some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.76,0:21:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经戒酒六个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six months sober.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.23,0:22:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我要说的 贡纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's what I'm talking about, Gunner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.90,0:22:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能甩掉他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you lose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.37,0:22:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们进去了 - 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're inside - Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.79,0:22:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,分头行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.09,0:22:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,加兰 我们去找目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Galan, we'll take point.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.21,0:22:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去追逃跑的混蛋 - 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You go after that squirter. - Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.98,0:22:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失去了50口径的机枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost the 50 cal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.66,0:22:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,把车停在他旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull up alongside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.42,0:23:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候即兴发挥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to improvise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.79,0:23:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以即兴发挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can improvise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.97,0:23:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,腹部中枪 你会活下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gut shot. You'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.57,0:23:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.24,0:23:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,加兰 你他妈的在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Galan, what the fuck are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.45,0:23:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在随机应变\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm improvising.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.72,0:23:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面发生了什么事 我要马上知道情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on in there I need a status report now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.64,0:23:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,再干掉一个就到拉赫马特了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more and we're on Rahmat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.78,0:24:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 轻松哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck, Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.53,0:24:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一轻松的一天就是昨天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only easy day was yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.54,0:24:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.58,0:24:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,首战告捷还是出师不利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initial success or total failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.10,0:24:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,首战告捷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initial success.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.56,0:24:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没子弹了 我要进攻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out of ammo. I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.94,0:24:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说出师不利吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean total failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.86,0:24:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞你在哪 他们拿到核炸药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christmas, where are you The detonators are compromised.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.66,0:25:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在西边 正往北走\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're on the west side heading north.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.83,0:25:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让拉赫马特带着核炸药离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let Rahmat leave with those detonators.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.62,0:25:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则会有很多人丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}or there's gonna be a lot of dead people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.71,0:25:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车吧 废柴们 我们要去购物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in, losers We're going shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.80,0:25:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to watch your six.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.60,0:25:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,往洞里开火 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire in the hole, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.02,0:25:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,转移\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.89,0:25:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.02,0:25:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.40,0:25:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心伙计 我永远不会抛弃你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, my friend. I would never leave you behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.02,0:26:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找不到好的射击角度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get the angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.57,0:26:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没热诱导弹了 - 该死 巴尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm out of flares. - Damn it, Barney.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.33,0:26:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续执行任务 圣诞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay on mission, Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.04,0:26:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在上面要完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're toast up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.79,0:26:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,听他的伙计 把核炸药拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to him, man. Get the detonators.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.21,0:26:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿核炸药 李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the detonators, Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.96,0:26:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.92,0:26:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的不行 我要救这个笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck no. I'm saving your dumb ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.98,0:26:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.11,0:26:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好伙计 但谁去阻止拉赫马特呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work, man, but who's on Rahmat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.02,0:28:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.22,0:28:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想你 巴尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We miss you, Barney.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.03,0:29:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.95,0:29:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有句老话说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an old expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.86,0:29:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个通常英年会早逝的行业里 要当心老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beware an old man in a profession where good men die young.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.79,0:29:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢肯定 他们为巴尼·罗斯在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure Barney Ross has had a seat reserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.33,0:29:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,留了很久的席位\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the big table up there for some time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.92,0:29:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他配得上那个位子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he earned that seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.92,0:29:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他永远都不会放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never stopped earning it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.00,0:29:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他激发了我们每个人最好的一面 因为他是我们中最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brought the best out in each and every one of us because he was the best of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.93,0:29:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬巴尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Barney.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.59,0:29:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬巴尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Barney.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.81,0:29:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.94,0:29:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.95,0:29:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要掩饰 李\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't gotta pretend, Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.32,0:29:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尼也不会想看你闷闷不乐的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know Barney wouldn't want to watch you sulking like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.95,0:29:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这倒是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.45,0:29:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.17,0:30:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 既然你问了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, since you're asking…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.80,0:30:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.17,0:30:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么时候去抓幕后黑手呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when are we going after the guys that did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.84,0:30:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪儿也不用去 你被开除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't going nowhere. You're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.43,0:30:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么意思 - 与你无关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that mean - You're off it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.93,0:30:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你出局了 - 胡扯 马什\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're done. You're out. - Bullshit, Marsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.44,0:30:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来管理巴尼的团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's gonna run Barney's team.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.65,0:30:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gina.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.45,0:30:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是在开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this, a bad joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.82,0:30:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你违抗了上级的直接命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you disobeyed a direct order from your superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.99,0:30:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们没完成任务 所以你被开除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that cost us the mission, so you're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.79,0:30:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是想救他 - 不过你没有做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was trying to save him. - Well, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.08,0:30:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的使命 也是我们的决定 你被开除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our play, it's our call. You're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.21,0:30:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是巴尼自己要做出的牺牲 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Barney's sacrifice to make, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.84,0:30:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于这次任务来说 舍身成仁 这意义很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good death for the mission, it would count.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.84,0:30:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你剥夺了他的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you just took it from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.84,0:30:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让他的牺牲毫无价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made his sacrifice worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.64,0:30:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.94,0:31:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.44,0:31:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the support.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.11,0:31:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真会挑日子 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You certainly picked your moment, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.38,0:31:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尼讨厌翻唱乐队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barney hated cover bands.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.64,0:31:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会保持联系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.52,0:31:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尼所做的一切不是都毫无价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing Barney did was worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.35,0:31:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你明白吗 什么都没有 - 嘿 冷静点 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You understand Nothing - Hey. Easy, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.86,0:31:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的 别在我面前谈论巴尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, talking about Barney in my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.19,0:31:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是合适的时间地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't the place or time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.53,0:31:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 冷静点伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Por favor. Please, please. Tranquilo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.34,0:32:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,备餐厨师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pantry cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.43,0:32:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒店总监\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hospitality director.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.14,0:32:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,要求“热情好客”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can be "hospitable-ish."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.89,0:32:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个社交网红的私人保镖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Private security detail for a social media influencer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.28,0:32:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go get a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.95,0:32:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们直播马上就要开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're about to go live.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.58,0:32:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将给大家看看这群垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're about to stream this shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.20,0:32:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you girls look like shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.58,0:32:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.09,0:32:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buh-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.50,0:32:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 肌肉男 - 到这来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, muscles. - Get over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.35,0:33:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 伙计 拿着我的告示牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, dude. Hold my sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.85,0:33:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的私人保镖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your private security detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.73,0:33:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来保护你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.65,0:33:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是来帮你拿牌子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not hold your sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.40,0:33:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得有人想要伤害我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see anybody looking to do me harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.07,0:33:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Potentially.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.28,0:33:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他呢 拿着牌子就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. Just hold the sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.04,0:33:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,「有可能」 那就看仔细 傻帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Potentially." Double-O douchebag.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.17,0:33:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好吗 王八蛋们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, motherfuckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.04,0:33:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在我的新奥尔良豪宅里 给你们现场直播\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here at my NOLA pad live streaming to you at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.55,0:33:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你们可悲的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bringing a little something-something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.01,0:33:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,带来点光彩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}into your pathetic little lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.55,0:33:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这些新奥尔良的婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at these NOLA bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.18,0:33:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等会要干哪一个 不不 哪两个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one… No, which two am I gonna fuck after.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.14,0:33:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 对女士们放尊重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oi. Have some respect for the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.94,0:33:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这直播呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am live streaming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.27,0:33:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们相信这些废话吗 看看这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys believe this shit Look at this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.44,0:33:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以为自己是谁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who does this motherfucker think he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.28,0:33:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 尊重女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Oi, respect the ladies."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.57,0:33:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尊重她们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll respect them all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.07,0:34:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊重她们 让她们舔掉我蛋蛋上的汗水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respect them enough to let them lick the sweat off my balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.70,0:34:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 伙计 我的鼻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck, dude, my nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.67,0:34:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我靠这张脸赚了多少钱吗 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how much money I make off this face, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.49,0:34:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.35,0:35:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.10,0:35:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}love.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.23,0:35:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该庆幸我没朝你开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky I didn't shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.77,0:35:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.56,0:35:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你现在能看懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, do you read now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.52,0:35:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.49,0:36:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要去什么地方 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going somewhere, are we.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.86,0:36:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要抓住杀害巴尼的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going after the guy that got Barney.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.99,0:36:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尼的死 唯一的好处就是公布了这份文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only good thing that came out of Barney's death was the unsealing of that file.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.54,0:36:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是什么意思 这里写了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck does that mean What's in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.08,0:36:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.04,0:36:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尼参与了多个国际机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barney was part of a classified operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.25,0:36:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,合作的秘密行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}in between international agencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.01,0:36:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情败露后 所有相关方决定封存档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when it went south, all the parties involved decided to seal the file.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.43,0:36:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到所有参与行动的人都死光\N{\fnArial\fs30}until everyone associated with it was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.55,0:36:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 巴尼死后这份文件就被解密了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So once Barney passed, that file was declassified.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.72,0:36:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我们了解了豹猫的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gave us a vital clue on Ocelot's identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.81,0:36:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要加入 我要和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want in. I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.36,0:36:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.86,0:36:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有被邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.16,0:36:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有我 你不会感到寂寞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, won't you be lonely without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.99,0:36:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.45,0:36:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有很多帅哥一起执行任务呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's lots of other boys on the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.37,0:36:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没那个心情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not in the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.08,0:36:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你表演个小本·亨德里克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna play a little Hendrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.50,0:37:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 通常很管用 - 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Usually does the trick. - Don't start.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.71,0:37:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.76,0:37:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直很喜欢这个纹身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I always liked this tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.89,0:37:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你兄弟也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So did your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.15,0:37:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一直是我在家里最喜欢的座位\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was always my favorite seat in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.40,0:37:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这座位可不白坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, these and the cheap seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.99,0:37:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really need to be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.37,0:37:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,说服我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.30,0:37:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮老战友一个忙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do an old soldier a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.68,0:37:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,先办急事\N{\fnArial\fs30}First things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.11,0:38:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我第一次见到巴尼的时候…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I first met Barney…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.78,0:38:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚从特种部队退役\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was straight out of the SAS.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.79,0:38:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有钱 处境很困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing to my name, down on my luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.55,0:38:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在别人都不愿意的时候 他给了我机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took a chance on me when no one else would.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.93,0:38:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会抓到杀害巴尼的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get the guy that did this to Barney.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.18,0:38:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.86,0:38:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我不能和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I can't go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.99,0:38:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我希望你带上这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I want you to take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.08,0:38:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,可好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.00,0:39:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会代你向拉赫马特问好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make sure to give Rahmat your regards.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.42,0:39:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大个尾背耳（粤语）\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a big, curly ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.84,0:39:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You catch any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.55,0:39:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道她在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what she's saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.59,0:39:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得为什么别人叫她鞭妹 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But why do you think they call her Lash - I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.43,0:39:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想知道 她可以随时鞭打我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'd love to find out. She can lash me anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.64,0:39:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 它比那个大得多亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's way bigger than that, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.02,0:40:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 那是中国的鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. That's the Chinese bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.14,0:40:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用中指 他们用小指\N{\fnArial\fs30}We use the middle finger, they use the pinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.40,0:40:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果合适的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if the shoe fits…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.07,0:40:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说你的耳朵怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was saying what's up with your ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.78,0:40:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的耳朵 - 哦 糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My ear - Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.32,0:40:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 大家都知道我在大学里是玩摔跤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, everybody knows I wrestled in college.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.53,0:40:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这项运动的一个常见后果就是耳朵挫伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a common affliction in that sport is that you get a contusion in the ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.78,0:40:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮肤与软骨被分开最后形成这样的饺子耳\N{\fnArial\fs30}that separates the cartilage from the skin and creates a little pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.79,0:40:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个已经是第九次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had this one drained nine times.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.62,0:40:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过他这么冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen him so quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.96,0:40:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,从本质上说上帝给了我盔甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}In essence, God gave me armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.04,0:40:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从巴尼死后 他什么都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hasn't said anything since Barney died.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.21,0:40:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一次我发现我的室友在谈论这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I caught my roommate talking shit about it one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.63,0:40:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不按着头把他的耳朵拧成花椰菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I had to smack him upside his head and give him his own cauliflower ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.05,0:40:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just the way it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.55,0:40:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想感受一下吗 不想吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to feel it No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.26,0:40:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会传染的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not contagious. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.39,0:41:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 打听一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.77,0:41:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找德夏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for Decha.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.11,0:41:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,德夏·尤奈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disha yunai.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.82,0:41:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.23,0:41:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是前泰国特种部队 第90师的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ex-Task Force 90. Thailand Special Forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.95,0:41:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说他有一艘船停靠在这附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supposedly owns a boat that docks around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.16,0:41:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 我不认识这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know anyone around here like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.16,0:41:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果他有一艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if he have boat,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.12,0:41:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,船在下面 而不是在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}boat down there, not up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.79,0:41:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.04,0:42:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 打扰一下朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, excuse me, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.59,0:42:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识这艘船的主人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the owner of this boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.05,0:42:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找一个叫德夏的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for a man named Decha.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.89,0:42:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 德夏很久以前就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Decha has long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.80,0:42:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah Where.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.14,0:42:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,去一个宁静的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}To a place of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.44,0:42:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.36,0:42:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这很常见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, there's a lot of that going around.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.95,0:43:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.74,0:43:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我不能让你偷走这艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let you steal this boat, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.49,0:43:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.16,0:43:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是一艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.33,0:43:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.00,0:43:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 不管你同不同意 我都要这艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen, I'm taking this boat with or without your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.47,0:43:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会有巴尼的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you have Barney's ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.93,0:43:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尼死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barney's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.81,0:43:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要这艘船来找到杀害他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need this boat to get to the people who killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.07,0:43:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找德夏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was looking for Decha.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.98,0:43:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,从巴尼对他的评价来看 他接下来会有很大的作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what Barney said about the man, I could use him for what's ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.15,0:43:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尼死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barney's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.78,0:43:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前叫德夏 你要找的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was once Decha, the man you seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.87,0:43:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我已经放下过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I put that man behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.96,0:43:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你说的是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If what you say is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.38,0:43:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得为巴尼报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barney should have his revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.96,0:43:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,太对了 就应该这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right, he should.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.86,0:44:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 大家听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.98,0:44:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰国金塔拉号货轮被劫持\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Thai cargo ship Jintara was hijacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.65,0:44:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的朋友拉赫马特在安达曼海\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the Andaman Sea by our mutual friend Rahmat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.32,0:44:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,金塔拉改变了路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Jintara has changed course.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.07,0:44:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它现在正驶向俄罗斯的海参崴海岸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and is tracking en route to the Russian coast of Vladivostok.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.95,0:44:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 由于利比亚的皇室混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, due to that royal clusterfuck that was Libya,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.83,0:44:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉赫马特已经拥有了核装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rahmat has taken possession of the nuclear detonators.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.00,0:44:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这艘船将举行一场交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ship itself is gonna be hosting an exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.09,0:44:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里 他们将获得制造核弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}where they'll be taking possession of the remaining nuclear materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.13,0:44:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所需的剩余核材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}needed to construct a viable bomb, nuclear type.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.55,0:44:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能让这种情况发生 明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we cannot let that happen. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.34,0:44:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得到消息说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we also have valuable intel that says.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.89,0:44:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,豹猫在金特拉号货船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Ocelot will be on the Jintara.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.43,0:44:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以也许这是唯一一个揭露他身份的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this might be our one and only chance to learn of his true identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.19,0:44:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或者她 - 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or her. - What's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.11,0:44:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能是个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be a her.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.61,0:45:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者「她」的身份 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or her identity, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.15,0:45:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们逮捕他或她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And bring him or her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.32,0:45:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都知道 巴尼的死揭露了这份文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you know, Barney's death opened up a file.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.74,0:45:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,揭露了和豹猫一起工作的人的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}that reveals the name of a man who worked with Ocelot.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.12,0:45:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个在证人保护计划中的证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A witness in witness protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.24,0:45:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,从鲁索那里了解更多他的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}More on him from Russo.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.66,0:45:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字叫他叫潘龙白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name's Phen Lyong Bai.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.83,0:45:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,豹猫的前搭档 他很乐意透露豹猫的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ocelot's former partner who'd love to rat Ocelot out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.04,0:45:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,告密者是没有好下场的 对吧 贡纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snitches get stitches. Right, Gunner.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.92,0:45:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 告密者没有好下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Snitches get stitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.92,0:45:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用我说你也知道这次任务有多棘手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to tell you how sensitive this mission is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.43,0:45:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果俄罗斯人得到风声说美军不仅在领土附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Russians get wind that the US forces are not only near.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.47,0:45:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且在俄罗斯领土内\N{\fnArial\fs30}but inside Russian territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.39,0:45:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会引起第三次世界大战级别的混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a World War III shit show.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.27,0:45:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.98,0:45:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此这次任务没有美国方面的签字\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's why this mission carries no US signature whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.40,0:45:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国会完全否认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full deniability.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.69,0:45:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果事情失控了 你们只能靠自己 然后最后一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this goes bad, it's on you. And one last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.65,0:45:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你们在没有我的情况下搞砸了在利比亚最后的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you Neanderthals dicked up that last mission in Libya without me,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.99,0:45:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be coming along to babysit you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.87,0:45:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是很有趣 吉娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, won't that be fun Gina.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.45,0:45:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这次任务就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so the mission's gonna go down like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.41,0:45:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将分两队进行这次攻击 每个队都有一个单独的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna run this assault as a split team with two separate objectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.75,0:46:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进去后\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna HALO in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.00,0:46:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,A队要守住舰桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Team Alpha's gonna secure the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.67,0:46:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,B队要彻底搜查这艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}while Bravo searches and sweeps the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.34,0:46:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找到并杀死豹猫和拉赫马特\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna identify, kill-capture both Ocelot and Rahmat,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.51,0:46:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保炸药和核部件的安全 然后坐直升机撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}secure the detonators and the nuclear components, helo extract.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.35,0:46:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.39,0:46:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对任务的说明和巴尼不一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is my delivery a little different than Barney's.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.23,0:46:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能会说 「我们上吧」\N{\fnArial\fs30}He probably would have just said, "Let's go."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.86,0:46:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.82,0:46:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.65,0:46:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.58,0:46:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一把斧头吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that an axe.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.25,0:46:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这只是一把雪铲\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's a snow shovel.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.29,0:46:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有道理 对你来说 就说得通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes sense. Not for humanity, but for you it makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.38,0:46:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你的故事是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. So what's your story.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.89,0:46:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尼告诉我 你是前90师前特遣部队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barney told me you were ex-Task Force 90.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.85,0:46:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,顶级杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultimate killer type.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.81,0:46:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从没见过比他更快更好的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seen anyone faster or better.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.02,0:47:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能杀人的次数有限 圣诞\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only so many times you can kill a man, Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.69,0:47:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each time,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.69,0:47:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它都变得更容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}it gets easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.03,0:47:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对痛苦、快乐和爱都变得麻木了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You become numb to pain, to joy, and to love.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.20,0:47:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,每杀一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}With every person you kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.29,0:47:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就失去了更多的自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you lose a little more of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.42,0:47:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须在失去一切之前停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to stop before there was nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.84,0:48:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我现在该用斧头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figured I'd be using my axe by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.34,0:48:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里太安静了 有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is too quiet. Something ain't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.80,0:49:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻松哥 鞭妹 你们跟我来 其他人绕到左舷船尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy Day, Lash, you're with me. The rest of you, swing around port quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.68,0:49:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,左舷船尾在哪儿来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's port quarter again.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.48,0:49:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是陆军 我们常说的是左右 而不是港口和星舰什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was Army. We said left and right, not port and starship shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.44,0:49:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,右舷是右边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starboard is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.23,0:49:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,左舷在左边 船尾在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Port, left. Quarter, back.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.19,0:49:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白了 - 我们上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got it. - Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.81,0:49:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有种不好的预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.56,0:49:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 人都去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, where the hell is everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.82,0:49:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,核弹肯定在飞机上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nuke is definitely onboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.65,0:49:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我有个坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen up. Bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.62,0:50:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经有了铀和核弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}They already have uranium with the detonators.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.12,0:50:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这艘船目前有一枚有效的核弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is now an active nuclear bomb on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.08,0:50:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就要过舰桥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're about to take the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.51,0:50:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就像一个鬼城\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a ghost town in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.72,0:50:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 放下你们的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go Put your weapons down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.44,0:50:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的 真是一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a fucking mess this turned out to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.40,0:50:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是利比亚 现在又是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}First Libya, now this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.11,0:50:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,两次都有人知道我们要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody knew we were coming. Both times.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.32,0:50:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的情报很可靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}My intel was solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.70,0:50:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的情报太糟糕了 - 啊 糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your intel was shit. - Ah, shit on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.53,0:50:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,情报可能已经泄露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The intel could have been leaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.62,0:50:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们对你不了解 - 他是没问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't know you. - He was verified.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.08,0:50:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那可能是你的新女友有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then maybe it was your new girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.91,0:50:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的 贡纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, Gunner.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.54,0:50:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经在维尔纽斯的任务上出卖了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sold us out in Vilena on that mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.25,0:50:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我会忘记这件事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I'd forget about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.50,0:50:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实有人出卖了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody did sell us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.88,0:50:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你的男人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about your man.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.09,0:50:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为了上位出卖了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sold him out so you could be on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.55,0:50:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点 她不会那样做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off. She wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.43,0:51:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么 要顶替他\N{\fnArial\fs30}What Fuck him on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.68,0:51:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.01,0:51:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是角落里那个沉默的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's the mute over in the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.97,0:51:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了加兰 说不出来话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, Galan Cat got your tongue, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.77,0:51:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 他有所隐瞒 - 的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, he's hiding something. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.85,0:51:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来不相信这个该死的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never trusted this fucking guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.41,0:51:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁是头儿 - 我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's the leader - I'm the leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.39,0:51:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.45,0:52:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.04,0:52:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.33,0:52:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.59,0:52:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.13,0:52:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我发出信号 你就跟过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send down a signal when it's clear for you to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.01,0:52:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能到这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is as far as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.26,0:52:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我需要你 - 我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I could use you. - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.39,0:52:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我把过去的我放出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I let the old me out,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.02,0:52:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我还能不能让他回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I could ever get him back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.65,0:52:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.50,0:53:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里应该是一场大屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should be carnage up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.26,0:53:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.59,0:53:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下班了 我要下楼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My shift's done. Going downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.45,0:54:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动 转过身来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move and turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.78,0:54:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.16,0:54:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 到底是哪一个呢 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, which one is it, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.08,0:54:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动还是慢慢转身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move or turn around slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.41,0:54:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,转身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.96,0:54:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.17,0:54:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.59,0:54:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,科林 你把我吓得要死你个笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colin, you scared the shit out of me, you bellend.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.51,0:54:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,科林 他妈的谁是科林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colin Who the fuck is Colin.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.39,0:54:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来这套 嘿 你得小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give me that. Hey, you need to be careful with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.93,0:54:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可能会在你手里爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That could go off in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.82,0:54:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,来得正是时候 马什先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect timing, Mr. Marsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.91,0:54:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,马什\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.83,0:54:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次任务是个圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}This mission was a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.83,0:54:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人泄露了我们的情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody leaked our intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.92,0:55:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的要求很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}My demands are simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.30,0:55:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,囚犯交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prisoner exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.22,0:55:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你的囚犯 潘龙白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want your prisoner, Phen Lyong Bai.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.30,0:55:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友的好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dear friend of a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.31,0:55:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.56,0:55:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,马什先生会证明我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Marsh will be the example of how deadly serious I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.60,0:55:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你会怎么做 鲁索\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's it going to be, Russo.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.44,0:55:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有这个权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have the authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.98,0:55:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.07,0:55:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…我知道有个人会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know someone who does.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.46,0:55:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,把最后一架假飞机架起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get the last of the fake planes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.07,0:56:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉赫马特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rahmat,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.98,0:56:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个狡猾的小香肠\N{\fnArial\fs30}you sneaky little sausage.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.12,0:56:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以给你授权\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get you the authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.99,0:56:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘龙白在你的监狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phen Lyong Bai is in your lockup.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.29,0:56:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的联系人是唐纳德·乌尔曼 授权号：2-2-5-7-9\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your contact is Donald Allman, authorization 2-2-5-7-9.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.25,0:56:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.46,0:56:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许耍花招\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no funny business.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.71,0:56:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,敢死队的死活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your call whether the Expendables.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.88,0:56:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,取决于你的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}need to live up to their namesake or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.31,0:57:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你们可悲的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bringing a little something-something.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.15,0:57:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,带来点光彩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}into your pathetic little lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.40,0:57:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这些婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at these bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.27,0:57:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等会要干哪一个 不不 哪两个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one… No, which two am I gonna fuck after.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.03,0:57:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 对女士们放尊重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oi. Have some respect for the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.66,0:57:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这直播呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am live streaming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.12,0:57:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们相信这些废话吗 看看这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys believe this shit Look at this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.33,0:57:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着这家伙 我崇拜他 他是我的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch this guy, I love him, he is my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.38,0:57:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尊重她们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll respect them all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.88,0:57:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊重她们 她们就会舔掉我蛋蛋上的汗水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respect them enough to let them lick the sweat off my balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.38,0:57:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望有一天能见到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope to meet him one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.57,0:58:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这把刀不是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This doesn't belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.62,0:58:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的队友们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.79,0:58:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的队友们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.29,0:58:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我们可能遇到麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we might have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.17,0:58:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,与佩顿和塔克失去联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paithoon and Takk have gone dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.72,0:58:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,二楼657房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Room 657, B-deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.18,0:58:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.77,0:58:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,贡纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunner.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.52,0:58:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呼叫塔克 - 不要介意哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Takk - Don't mind if I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.40,0:58:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告情况 塔克 我们船上可能有只老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Report back, Takk. We may have a rat onboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.28,0:58:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查每个人的状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check everyone's status.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.24,0:58:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takk.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.53,0:59:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔克目前无法回复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takk can't come to the phone right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.16,0:59:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有点瘸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a little limp.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.20,0:59:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.12,0:59:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个不小心让你跑了的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man who made a mistake letting you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.96,0:59:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是来补救的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm here to remedy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.17,0:59:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看是谁想当英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look who's still trying to be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.38,0:59:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能上船真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How nice of you to come aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.01,0:59:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你希望能解决利比亚的问题 很抱歉你来晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're hoping for a redo of the mess in Libya, you're too late, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.14,0:59:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人正赶来送你上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}My men are on their way to hunt you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.14,0:59:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我想应该让你早点入土为安了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess it's up to me to put you in an early grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.02,0:59:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像在利比亚我对你朋友做的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like I did your friend in Libya.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.48,0:59:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,纠正一下 他不是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correction. He wasn't my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.24,0:59:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.03,0:59:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以带上你的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can bring your army.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.66,0:59:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的人都带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring all the fucking men you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.53,0:59:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会一个一个地解决他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll work through every last one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.49,0:59:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我抓到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I get to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.12,0:59:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会确保你离开这艘船的唯一方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make sure that the only way you leave this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.29,0:59:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是碎尸万段\N{\fnArial\fs30}is in a wonderful variety of pieces.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.96,1:00:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要对着炸弹开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shoot by the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.44,1:01:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕维尔 你看到老鼠了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pavel, you have eyes on the rat.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.99,1:01:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的长官 - 位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - Location.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.91,1:01:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一楼走廊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corridor, deck one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.17,1:01:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 第二层甲板 - 什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Deck two. - What.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.77,1:02:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,军官餐厅 三甲板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officers' dining area, deck three.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.16,1:03:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路走好 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rubber side down, mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.38,1:04:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在船尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on the stern.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.10,1:05:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.65,1:05:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你不会再过这种生活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you were done with this life.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.27,1:05:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,让巴尼的朋友死是对巴尼的不尊重\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be disrespectful to Barney's memory to let his friend die.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.11,1:05:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个造型\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the look.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.49,1:05:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.74,1:05:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我们开始吧 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then let's get to it. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.89,1:05:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里一切都封得严严实实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's sealed tight down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.68,1:05:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 焊接得也很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, these are welded up solid too.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.44,1:05:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那接下来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so what's next.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.90,1:05:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,舱底排水系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bilge system.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.81,1:05:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 舱底的排水系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What - Bilge system.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.52,1:05:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在紧急情况下 水会被排到船上干燥的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}In emergencies, it clears water from the ship's dry areas.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.61,1:05:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能打开它 我们应该就能离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you get it open, it should let us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.36,1:05:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧伙计 让我们把这该死的东西打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. Let's get this fucking thing open.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.66,1:06:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 根本没动 - 别废话 得弄湿才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, that ain't budging. - No shit. It's got to get wet.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.25,1:06:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.17,1:06:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它是湿的 就可以打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wet. If it gets wet, it'll open.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.88,1:06:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 有人想小便吗 - 我要尿尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, anybody gotta pee - I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.01,1:06:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跳伞到这里后 我还没尿过尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had to piss since we HALO'd in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.89,1:06:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,请给我一点隐私好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little privacy, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.28,1:06:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,舌骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hyoid bone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.45,1:06:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是人体中唯一一块与其他骨骼没有连接的骨骼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only bone in the human body not connected to any others.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.66,1:06:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就在嘴里 没有它你就没法说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right here in the throat. Without it, we cannot speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.96,1:06:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要用手 把拉赫马特那个混蛋的舌骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}With these hands, I will claw the hyoid bone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.25,1:06:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,从喉咙里拔出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the throat of that fucker Rahmat,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.17,1:06:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,插进他男朋友的屁眼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}stick it up his boyfriend's culo,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.05,1:06:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后让他们两个都道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}then make both of their asses apologize.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.63,1:06:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后让他们溺死在自己的血液里\N{\fnArial\fs30}while they drown in their own blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.05,1:07:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尼是我的榜样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barney was my hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.51,1:07:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想说了 我不能说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not speak, I cannot speak,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.26,1:07:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我的脑子里充满了这些残酷的幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}because my mind is full of these brutal, visceral fantasies,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.31,1:07:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象一下我会把它变成可怕的现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}fantasies that will now become a hellish reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.57,1:07:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该继续保持沉默\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go back to not talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.41,1:07:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 谁愿意钻进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Done. - Any takers.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.08,1:07:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能帮我们找到杀害巴尼的凶手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will lead us to the men who killed Barney.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.17,1:07:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.96,1:07:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要为他报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will avenge him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.80,1:07:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来他喜欢「黄金雨」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess he does like golden showers.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.01,1:07:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说话这会儿 龙白已经在路上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lyong Bai is en route to you as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.73,1:07:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我的队员能活着回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expect to have my team returned alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.40,1:07:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以 不信守承诺还算什么男人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. For what is a man without his word.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.15,1:07:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好交换的准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare for exchange.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.49,1:07:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.95,1:08:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这边走 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This way. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.91,1:08:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的队友见到你一定会很高兴的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends will be really happy to see you, right.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.45,1:08:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably not.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.45,1:08:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉娜会不得不承认她需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gina will have to admit she needs me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.25,1:08:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 数到三 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On three. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.62,1:08:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.00,1:08:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.17,1:08:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.67,1:08:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did they go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.51,1:08:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闻到尿味了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smell piss.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.05,1:08:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.80,1:08:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要保持安静 直到该大声说话时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna stay quiet until it's time to get loud.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.98,1:08:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 来 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.48,1:08:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.69,1:08:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候大声说话了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to get loud.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.78,1:08:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才需要趴在地上 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you who needs to get down on the ground, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.78,1:08:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.08,1:08:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然会被敢死队干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or get wasted by an Expendable.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.92,1:08:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我 你见到我很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me. You're happy to see me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.75,1:09:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格来说你已经不是敢死队了 圣诞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically, you're not an Expendable anymore, Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.63,1:09:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.51,1:09:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Such a pleasure. - Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.64,1:09:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,时机很好 轻松哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great timing. Easy Day.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.18,1:09:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feliz Navidad.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.06,1:09:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的斧头吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that my Traumahawk.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.43,1:09:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 你喜欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - How do you like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.06,1:09:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我越来越喜欢了 - 你怎么这么久才来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Growing on me. - What took you so long.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.90,1:09:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我会相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you think that I was gonna believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.07,1:09:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是把刀送给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were actually just gifting me your knife.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.57,1:09:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把你的刀送给她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gifted her your knife.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.36,1:09:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说浪漫已死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they say romance is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.99,1:09:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在刀里放了追踪器 不过这都是我计划的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}He put a tracker in it. It was all part of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.37,1:09:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.50,1:09:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得有点被利用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel a little used.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.05,1:09:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.13,1:09:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 贡纳 注意身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Gunner, watch our six.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.55,1:09:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like your hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.76,1:09:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的新朋友是谁 - 德夏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's your new friend - Decha.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.84,1:09:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尼的老朋友 他们中的佼佼者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old friend of Barney's. Kicks ass with the best of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.81,1:09:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尼的朋友对我来说都很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any friend of Barney's is all right by me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.02,1:09:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉赫马特绑架了马什 - 我很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rahmat took Marsh. - I'm devastated.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.02,1:09:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,当务之急 托尔·罗德 我需要你看一样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}First things first. Toll Road, I need you to take a look at something.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.61,1:10:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个巨大的炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a big fucking bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.28,1:10:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没拿到的核炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the detonators that we didn't get.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.57,1:10:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're fucked.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.91,1:10:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能详细说明吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you elaborate.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.45,1:10:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意儿27分钟后就会爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing's wired to go in 27 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.08,1:10:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是防篡改的 有水银开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tamperproof. Got mercury switches.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.37,1:10:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭这玩意儿的唯一方法就是找到远程终止开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way we're shutting this bad boy down is to find the remote kill switch.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.63,1:10:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是最后一道防线\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the last line of defense.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.17,1:10:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是近距离控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, it's short range,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.42,1:10:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以不管谁带着它 都会在这艘船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}so whoever has that on their person is on this fucking boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.42,1:10:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉赫马特 - 拉赫马特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rahmat. - Rahmat.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.80,1:10:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是拉赫马特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Rahmat.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.97,1:10:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他杀了巴尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy who killed Barney.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.64,1:10:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能刚进入俄罗斯海域\N{\fnArial\fs30}We probably just entered Russian waters.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.26,1:10:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这艘船被装扮成了一艘美国航空母舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dressing this ship to look like a US aircraft carrier.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.64,1:10:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且带着一枚即将在俄罗斯海岸爆炸的核弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a primed nuke about to blow off the coast of Russia.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.35,1:10:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将引发第三次世界大战\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to start World War III.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.86,1:10:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间紧迫 准备行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clock is ticking. Let's lock and load.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.82,1:10:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,新位置 甲板边\N{\fnArial\fs30}New location, deckside.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.11,1:10:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的关键就是这个终止开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all about this kill switch now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.07,1:10:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉拉赫马特才能终止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch off Rahmat permanently.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.66,1:10:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你能给我们做个「又吵又闹的家伙」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, can you make us something loud and messy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.24,1:10:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,教皇会在树林里拉屎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does the pope shit in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.58,1:10:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 教皇不会在树林里拉屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the pope don't shit in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.50,1:10:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会在一只熊旁边拉屎 你为什么要问这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or next to a bear. Why you gotta say shit like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.63,1:11:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.67,1:11:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit Bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.00,1:12:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.40,1:12:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.45,1:12:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.71,1:13:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.13,1:13:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.60,1:13:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我支持你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.73,1:13:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.58,1:13:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, puta.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.76,1:14:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来对付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.57,1:14:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔·罗德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toll Road.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.78,1:14:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻松哥 有人受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy Man down Man down.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.75,1:14:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能亲一下吗 那会让我好受点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you kiss that and make it better.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.67,1:14:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚点吧 我现在有点忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe later. I'm a little busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.30,1:14:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.34,1:15:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备交换囚犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready for prisoner exchange.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.47,1:15:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,三分钟后着陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three minutes until we touch down.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.43,1:15:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standing by for the exchange.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.72,1:15:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,按计划进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceed as planned.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.50,1:15:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 拉赫马特\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing, Rahmat.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.79,1:15:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你喜欢玩刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you like to play with knives.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.84,1:15:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I ain't playing no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.21,1:15:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,把终止开关给我 我们就能结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna give me the kill switch, and we're gonna end all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.13,1:15:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,来拿啊 英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get it, hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.08,1:17:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你最拿手的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the biggest one you've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.57,1:17:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.53,1:17:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我最拿手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the biggest one I got.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.70,1:17:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee, you good.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.20,1:17:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.67,1:17:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,终止开关在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the kill switch.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.96,1:18:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋 我没有终止开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking idiot. I don't have the kill switch.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.26,1:18:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老板有\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boss has it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.47,1:18:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,豹猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ocelot.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.49,1:18:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘龙白来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phen Lyong Bai is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.33,1:18:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是能认出豹猫的证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's our witness that can identify Ocelot.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.00,1:18:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 白 - 哦 我的天哪 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, Bai. - Oh, my God, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.96,1:18:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 再见了 白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No - Bye-bye, Bai.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.52,1:18:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,马什就是豹猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marsh is Ocelot.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.14,1:18:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,终止开关一直都在他那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's had the kill switch this whole…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.40,1:19:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是给巴尼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for Barney.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.24,1:19:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多久会爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long until detonation.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.41,1:19:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,12分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.62,1:19:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们有12分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we got 12 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.33,1:19:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,让船像烟花一样爆炸吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}before this ship blows up like a Roman candl…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.42,1:19:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 马什 我想你不再需要那个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Marsh. I guess you won't be needing that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.34,1:19:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 圣诞\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.30,1:19:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就像有性病一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like genital warts.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.14,1:19:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是出现在不该出现的地方 而且赶都赶不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always showing up where you're not wanted and refusing to go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.52,1:19:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有我想要的东西 马什\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got something I need, Marsh.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.86,1:19:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下来拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming down to get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.19,1:19:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你发现了这个装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you figured out that this device right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.90,1:19:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是唯一能阻止第三次世界大战的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the only thing preventing World War III,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.32,1:19:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场冲突虽然对很多人来说是毁灭性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}a conflict that, while devastating for many,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.91,1:19:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也同样是疯狂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll be insanely,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.16,1:19:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯狂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}insanely,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.41,1:19:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,给某个人带来了疯狂的利润\N{\fnArial\fs30}insanely profitable for somebody.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.21,1:20:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that somebody is gonna be me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.54,1:20:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,敢死队会承担所有的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Expendables will take all the blame.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.00,1:20:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以好好欣赏这场表演吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, enjoy the show.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.43,1:20:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀光他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.68,1:20:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,找掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take cover.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.10,1:20:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody get down.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.56,1:20:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这艘船 不然我们都会被炸死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get clear of this boat or we're all gonna get fried.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.69,1:20:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在来看跳海是个不错的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jumping overboard is seeming like a decent plan right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.36,1:20:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能逃出爆炸区 时间不够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll never make it out of the blast zone. We'll never make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.12,1:20:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计 你不能在我眼皮底下死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, you're not going down on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.74,1:20:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了 他失血过多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta move. He's bleeding out.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.66,1:20:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.17,1:20:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以坐我的船 它在后面拖着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can take my boat. It's being towed.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.25,1:20:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.54,1:20:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来我们就从这里动身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time, let's start with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.13,1:20:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.30,1:20:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,贡纳 火力掩护 我们要出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunner, give us cover fire. We're on the way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.47,1:20:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 火力掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that. Cover fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.14,1:21:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在船尾会合 重复 在船尾会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet at the stern. Repeat, meet at the stern.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.02,1:21:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta move.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.24,1:21:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他们去了另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw them go to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.51,1:21:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰桥上没人 开始搜船\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no one on the bridge. Start searching the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.48,1:21:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔·罗德 下一个就是你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toll Road, you're next.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.99,1:21:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,加兰 该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Galan, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.92,1:22:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.72,1:22:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.26,1:22:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.62,1:22:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务优先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mission first.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.46,1:22:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得让这艘船掉头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta turn this ship around.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.05,1:22:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我的牺牲有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make my sacrifice count.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.14,1:23:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他自己的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.77,1:23:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,德夏 我们得走了 不然托尔·罗德就撑不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decha, we need to move or Toll Road's not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.14,1:25:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,把剩下的充气船弄上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the rest of the inflatable boats up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.14,1:25:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我们的船掉头驶向大海了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we're headed back out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.06,1:25:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it, move it, move it, people.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.11,1:25:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的性病男\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genital fucking warts.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.95,1:25:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.95,1:25:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,去给汽艇充气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that RIB inflated.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.70,1:25:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要让船回到正轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get the ship back on course.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.25,1:25:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,到舰桥上去把这个修好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up to the bridge and fix this.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.12,1:25:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是长官…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, sir…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.92,1:25:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, sir, what.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.17,1:25:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,核弹要爆炸了 我们不能上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nuke is gonna blow. We can't go up…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.42,1:25:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得升职怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel about a promotion.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.18,1:25:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,都到舰桥上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.80,1:25:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉他 所有人上舰桥 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him down All to the bridge Go, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.53,1:26:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们很快就能见面了 巴尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like I'll be seeing you soon, Barney.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.56,1:27:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.99,1:27:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里 马什\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here, Marsh.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.07,1:27:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你把骑兵都叫来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you called in the cavalry.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.70,1:27:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你摆脱不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you can't get rid of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.24,1:27:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝试才有乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the fun's in trying.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.08,1:27:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不下来面对面谈谈呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come down face-to-face.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.50,1:27:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,单挑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man-to-man.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.88,1:27:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,老一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old school.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.76,1:27:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就别怪我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mind if I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.72,1:27:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都等不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.05,1:27:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的别动 我马上下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you fucking move I'll be right down.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.97,1:27:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尼25年前试图揭发我 但他失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barney tried to expose me 25 years ago, and he failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.31,1:28:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你 你是个好士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you, you're a good soldier.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.81,1:28:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个非常优秀的士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a very good soldier.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.61,1:28:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这个超出了你的能力范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this, I mean, this is above and beyond.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.69,1:28:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是更高的层次\N{\fnArial\fs30}This… This is next level.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.82,1:28:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尼会为你感到骄傲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barney would be proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.41,1:28:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以亲自告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you can tell him yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.16,1:28:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你马上就要去见他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're about to join him.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.46,1:28:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So very nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.50,1:28:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看圣诞老人给我带来了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what Santa brought me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.30,1:28:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.89,1:28:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barney.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.02,1:28:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我马上要用经典神器干掉了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I had him with the classics.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.06,1:28:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的差点杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You almost fucking killed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.56,1:28:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.61,1:28:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.78,1:28:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fuck is happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.24,1:28:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.20,1:29:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 核弹在哪里 - 在船尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are the nukes - In the stern.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.12,1:29:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你已经死了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.67,1:29:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到底怎么回事 - 我有点忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The hell's going on - I'm a little busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.53,1:29:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's the story.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.78,1:29:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,25年前 我们执行了一项秘密任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-five years ago, we were doing a covert op,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.20,1:29:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的八名队员被消灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and eight of my team got wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.25,1:29:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不伪造自己的死亡来公开一份机密文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to fake my own death to open up a classified file,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.00,1:29:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把马什引出来 这样我才能证明他是豹猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}driving Marsh out of hiding so I could prove he's Ocelot.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.71,1:29:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么瞒着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you keep it from us.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.34,1:29:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没有接那个秘密任务 我的队员都还会活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I didn't take that job, they'd all be alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.34,1:29:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这是私人恩怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it was personal.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.55,1:29:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.88,1:30:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.93,1:30:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.64,1:30:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你请客 - 我破产了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're buying. - I'm broke.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.80,1:30:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话比你死的时候更搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were funnier when you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.68,1:30:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴又和你在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great spending time with you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.31,1:30:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你需要洗个澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you could use a shower.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.25,1:31:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔·罗德 你欠我20块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toll Road, you owe me 20 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.62,1:31:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你不需要戴眼镜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess you won't be needing glasses.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.04,1:31:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.09,1:31:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我那些永不放弃的朋友们致敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salute to my friends who never quit.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.17,1:31:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你们所有人干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers to you all.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.51,1:31:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干杯 - 干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Salud. - Salute.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.63,1:31:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,向你们致敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}To you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.30,1:31:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,船上那句老掉牙的话怎么说来着 圣诞\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about that corny quote on the ship, Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.85,1:31:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不用再重复了 托尔·罗德 - 「让我的牺牲有价值 」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't need to repeat that, Toll Road. - "Make my sacrifice count "
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.68,1:31:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 去你的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.94,1:31:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再为难他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop giving him such a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.77,1:31:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这很甜蜜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.48,1:31:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 真甜蜜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw. That's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.48,1:31:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都嫉妒你 因为你是最帅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all just jealous because you're the most handsome one.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.99,1:31:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.03,1:31:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱情不是很美好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't love beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.53,1:31:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 托尔·罗德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Toll Road.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.49,1:31:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.95,1:31:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尼·罗斯 起死回生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barney Ross, back from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.21,1:31:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你能毫发无伤地从熊熊烈火中走出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only you could walk away from a blazing inferno with not a scratch on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.17,1:31:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就像一只凤凰 浴火重生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are like a mythical bird raising up from the ashes.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.21,1:31:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不明白你是怎么做到的 - 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know how you do it. - Just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.17,1:31:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很放松 我在跟我的英雄说话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am relaxed. I'm trying to talk to my hero over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.38,1:32:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能给我点空间吗 轻松哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you give me some space please, Easy Day.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.18,1:32:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 笨蛋 有时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, lame brain, you got a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.18,1:32:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然有 - 一个小问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course. - A minor question.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.93,1:32:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step right in.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.22,1:32:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,它来了 一个破戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is. Piece of junk.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.39,1:32:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想死这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed this.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.89,1:32:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 我的朋友 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks, my friend. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.77,1:32:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想知道 - 尸体是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need to know. - Who the corpse is.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.23,1:32:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.32,1:32:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有想过珍宝虾怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever wonder what happened to Jumbo Shrimp.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.91,1:32:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告 前方地势太低\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning. Terrain ahead. Too low.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.29,1:32:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告 没有起落装置 请拉升\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning. No landing gear. Pull up.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.05,1:32:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没在飞机上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.97,1:32:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我跳伞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.25,0:00:46.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（利比亚 卡扎菲旧军用化工厂）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.73,0:04:00.07,Title,0,0,0,0,,《敢死队4：最终章》
